1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,033
He sleeps with his headphones on.
Music all night. That's the only
reason he didn't hear whatever called
the others.

2
00:00:07,533 --> 00:00:13,733
I woke up at six. Everybody was
walking out. Slowly. Like
sleepwalking. I yelled. Nobody turned
around.

3
00:00:14,233 --> 00:00:19,967
So I put on my raincoat and I went to
the bus stop. Because it said 7:10.
And then I just waited.

4
00:00:20,467 --> 00:00:26,400
I don't say anything. I kneel on the
pavement and hold on to him. My hands
are shaking. I can't stop them.

5
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:32,467
I was asleep. I was asleep in a chair,
and you were out here all alone.

6
00:00:32,967 --> 00:00:35,433
But you came. That's the rule I like
best.
